    "name": "deep-research-team",
    "description": "This skill should be used when the user asks for \"deep research\", \"research team\", \"comprehensive analysis\", \"research report\", \"investigate thoroughly\", \"compare X vs Y in depth\", or needs synthesis across multiple sources with verification. It spawns a coordinated team of researcher agents across multiple rounds, with the lead triaging findings and creating targeted follow-up tasks. Scales from Focused (2 researchers, 1-2 rounds) to Comprehensive (4 researchers, 3-4 rounds with cross-verification). Do NOT use for simple lookups, debugging, or questions answerable with 1-2 searches.\n",
